---
/**
 * AboutStrip — the centered "Who We Are" mission statement below the hero.
 */
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <div class="section-eyebrow about-eyebrow">Who We Are</div>
    <p class="about-quote">
      "We are a fitness collective brought together through our love of all
      things health &amp; wellness — dedicated to aging gracefully and being a
      better version of ourselves each year."
    </p>
    <p class="about-body">
      High-energy group fitness combining functional training, bodybuilding, and
      aerobic conditioning — in a safe, inclusive, and flat-out epic
      environment. All levels welcome. Every movement scalable.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--dark-1);
    padding: 80px 48px;
  }
  .about-inner {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .about-eyebrow {
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .about-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .about-body {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about {
      padding-left: 24px;
      padding-right: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
